  "description": "Product Description\n\nTHE CROW PASS IS AN ADVENTURER’S DELIGHT.\n\nLike its Chugach Mountains namesake, Crow Pass is inspired by glaciers, waterfalls, wildflowers, wildlife, & mine ruins. This versatile bike incorporates the stiff yet supple qualities of a gravel bike with the sturdy versatility of a fat bike. This bike is as smooth on dirt and snow as it is on the pavement.\n\nThe careful shaping and cold working of the Crow Pass’ titanium tubeset gives it remarkable strength and bottom bracket stiffness while delivering a smooth and comfortable ride.\n\nDetails like anodized graphics, polished frame finish and a custom engraved head badge exclusive to this model are a testament to our commitment to quality and esthetics while delivering precision handling and reducing vibration when needed.",
